%% Read bottom-up: this is the actual dependency order, derived by working
%% backwards from the SOTA claim to what's blocking it right now. Step 1 is
%% the next concrete action, not the first item chronologically attempted.
flowchart BT
    classDef next fill:none,stroke:#b8862f,stroke-width:3px,color:currentColor
    classDef later fill:none,stroke:currentColor,stroke-width:1px,color:currentColor

    S1["1. Diagnose driver.py's real import:\ncheck sys.path / cwd the conductor\nlaunches autofde_lab_dspy with vs.\nwhat 'import driver' expects"]:::next
