    S3["3. Run ONE real attempt:\nreal diagnosis + real mitigation,\nsame misconfig_app_hotel_res problem"]:::later
    S4["4. Confirm solved=True on the\nreal act event, independent verify()\nagrees, real OCEL log validates\nand replays conformant"]:::later
    S5["5. Construct one real\nStandingEvidence / CrownReceipt\nfrom that episode -- no fields\nfabricated, admit() must pass"]:::later
    S6["6. Repeat for a real spread of\nproblems (sregym-lite suite),\nnot one lucky pass"]:::later
    S7["7. Build the real FrontierResult\nset: pareto_frontier() over the\nN admitted StandingEvidence points"]:::later
    S8["8. Collect the actual published\nSREGym baseline numbers for the\nsame metric space (same units,\nsame problem set)"]:::later
    S9(["9. dominates() / metrics_dominate():\nreal comparison, admitted or refused --\nthe answer is allowed to be 'not yet'"]):::later

